<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH ZIVNO FUND Q1 PROFIT RISES.</title>
<headline>CZECH ZIVNO FUND Q1 PROFIT RISES.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for three month period ending March 31, 1997, according to Czech accounting standards (in millions of crowns):</p>
<p> Gross profit		    95.57	  vs	 19.22</p>
<p>Profit from financial</p>
<p> operations			97.43	  vs	 19.85</p>
<p> Operating profit		-1.86 (loss) vs	 -0.63 (loss)</p>
<p> Total assets		 2,991.92	  vs    2,866.18</p>
<p> Basic capital		1,962.10	  vs    1,962.21</p>
<p>NOTE: Full company name is a.s. Zivnobanka - 1. Investicni Fond. The fund is managed by ZB Trust, an investment arm of bank Zivnobanka a.s.. The fund's shares are traded on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange (PSE). Results were provided by the PSE.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, +420-2-2423-0003</p>
